      },
      {
        "title": "rain vs rainy",
        "words": [
          "rain",
          "rainy"
        ],
        "explanation_ar": "rain اسم (المطر) أو فعل (تمطر: It is raining). rainy صفة (ممطر: a rainy day).",
        "explanation_en": "\"Rain\" is a noun or verb. \"Rainy\" is an adjective.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "rain",
            "sentence": "It is raining outside."
          },
          {
            "word": "rainy",
            "sentence": "I always forget my umbrella on rainy days."
